# Do not put service secrets here.
# Copy the .env.example in each service layer:
#   identity/frontend/.env.example
#   identity/backend/.env.example
#   webonone-v2/frontend/.env.example
#   webonone-v2/backend/.env.example
#
# Local dev ports (strict — each service fails if its port is taken):
#   WebOnOne  FE 3010  BE 4010
#   Identity  FE 3011  BE 4011
#   UI Kit    FE 3012  (showcase only)
#   Media     FE 3013  BE 4013
#   Email     FE 3014  BE 4014
#   Data      FE 3015  BE 4015
